 "note": "TRIAL (2026-11-18), the everyday cut from the accepted stance stand_sword_j6 and back to it. From the wind (old t130) to the end of the follow (old t440) it is sword_cut exactly, 100 ms later. Start: a small sink with the sword dipping lower behind, little steps in, the sword rising clockwise behind the back into the wind. Return: a recoil on planted feet with the blade carried on down past the near thigh, a bound back home (travel only while both feet are up), a landing that sinks past the stance with the sword swinging a little past its rest, then the stance (the last frame is stand_sword_j6@0). Made by art/redo/stand/mktrial_j.py.",
